   'The verb "pôr" has irregularities in its conjugation (eu ponho, ele põe), so it is classified as irregular.'),
  ('f16a8867-0a61-4b7e-995c-ee4f5fc3249b', 'es',
   'En la gramática normativa, el verbo portugués "pôr" (poner) se considera un verbo:',
